  <article>
    <h1>About GearPilot AI</h1>
    <p>GearPilot AI is being developed as a US-focused resource for standing-desk and home-office product discovery. The goal is to help people compare practical fit and documented product information before they shop.</p>

    <h2>What the site does today</h2>
    <p>The public finder currently uses synthetic demonstration records to illustrate filters and ranking behavior. These records are fictional examples, not real products, prices, reviews, or purchase recommendations. Research candidates remain separate and unpublished until their exact configuration and evidence have been independently reviewed.</p>
    <p>GearPilot AI does not claim hands-on testing, verified customer reviews, established traffic, merchant partnerships, or commission earnings. There are no active affiliate links.</p>

    <h2>How comparisons are intended to work</h2>
    <p>Comparisons focus on the selected workspace, product dimensions, adjustment range, stated capacity, current sourced price and availability, and applicable warranty and return information. Sources and observation dates matter: an unknown fact stays unknown rather than being filled in from a different configuration.</p>
    <p>Read the <a href="/guides/standing-desk-fit/">standing-desk fit guide</a> for general shopping considerations and the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> for evidence and eligibility rules. These resources are educational, not medical or ergonomic assessments.</p>

    <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
    <p>If affiliate relationships are approved in the future, they will be disclosed and kept separate from recommendation scores. Affiliate status or commission rates will not determine which products qualify or how they rank.</p>
    <p>The site's legal operator and monitored contact channel have not yet been published. The <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> explains this limitation; owner identity and contact details will be added only after the operator supplies and verifies them.</p>
  </article>
